// Windows: Security event log cleared
// MITRE ATT&CK: Defense Evasion - T1070.001 Clear Windows Event Logs
// Clearing the Security log destroys evidence. Legitimate reasons are rare,
// so this is high severity. The logs already sent to Sentinel survive - which
// is exactly why central log collection matters.
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 1102
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Account, Activity
